# Original game and everything derived from it: rebuilt from the ISO with tools/
# (see game/README.md "Rebuilding the assets"). EA's property, kept out of history.
# game/assets/ is all of that, except sprites/oscf_starter/, oscf_roles/ and oscf_rendered/
# (tools/blender): our own original art (generated player sprites), tracked; and models/,
# the 3D edition's footballer (tools/blender/footballer_gltf.py), ours too.
FIFA96.ISO
extracted/
downloads/
decoded/
game/assets/*
!game/assets/models/
!game/assets/sprites/
